  "bodyHash": "1781fed6c4f97f06",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Overflowing Bars</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 將《我的世界》的生命值、護甲與護甲強韌度條突破原版上限，同時保持緊湊易讀。此模組不額外增加圖示列，而是將條狀圖堆疊成清晰的層次，大幅節省空間。📊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">當你的數值超過原版上限時，行計數器會精確顯示你擁有多少層生命值、護甲或護甲強韌度。無需背誦顏色配置，也不用猜測目前看到的是哪一層。🔢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">本模組亦新增了專屬的護甲強韌度條，將一項重要的防禦數值帶入原本原版未顯示的 HUD 中。🛡️</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要正確支援超出原版上限的護甲與強韌度數值，請安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributefix\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">AttributeFix</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（由 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/DarkhaxDev\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">DarkhaxDev</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 開發）。🌟</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">❤️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">緊湊的生命值顯示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 將生命值堆疊超過十顆心，且不會在 HUD 中額外增加列。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">突破原版的護甲上限：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 顯示高護甲數值，僅使用必要的空間。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💎 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">護甲強韌度條：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 新增專屬的強韌度顯示，讓你隨時掌握這項重要的防禦數值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔢 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">清晰的層數計數器：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 每個堆疊的條狀圖皆可顯示數字指示器，精確呈現目前的層數。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">易讀的配色方案：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 以原版顏色作為基礎層，並為堆疊層使用單一突顯色，避免令人混淆的彩虹式顯示。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📏 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">節省空間的 HUD：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 即使生命值、護甲或強韌度數值極高，依然保持緊湊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">聊天相容性修復：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 防止聊天訊息覆蓋與護甲相關的 HUD 元素。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可自訂版面配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 調整位置、堆疊行為、計數器與顯示選項，以符合你偏好的 HUD 設定。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端必須安裝此模組</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若該模組提供設定功能，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行設定（Fabric 版本需安裝由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 開發的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案皆位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 資料夾內，檔名分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，取決於設定檔類型。並非所有模組都會包含所有類型的設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/locusway\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">LocusWay</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overpowered-armor-bar\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Overpowered Armor Bar</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組，啟發了多層護甲條的設計。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Vazkii\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Vazkii</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Quark</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組，啟發了護甲與強韌度疊加圖示的設計。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/cadaverous_queen\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">cadaverous_queen</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rustic\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Rustic</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組提供了護甲強韌度圖示及該條狀圖的原始構想。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mdiyo\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">mDiyo</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mantle\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mantle</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組最初提出了堆疊愛心顯示的創意。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-windows\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwindows/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/new-health-bars\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/healthbars/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/visual-workbench\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
